    "Name": "Kiso",
    "Details": "The <i>Kiso</i> was created as a \"command\" construction vehicle for large planetary construction projects. Somebody in the Periphery decided that enough was enough, and thus the \"Periphery Rising\" was born. Most of the original construction equipment has been stripped out, leaving only the communications suite, which has since been dialed in for coordinating lances of BattleMechs, rather than construction vehicles.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Rugged</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.99</color></b>",
